From dc5946fe5af08d1cc07d52b5bd195c50e500e641 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Parthiban Nallathambi <parthiban@linumiz.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 23:12:48 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] v850: Add FXU instructions and intrinsics

Add patterns for the FXU arithmetic, conversion, compare, move, shuffle
and lane instructions, and an intrinsics header that exposes them to C.

Signed-off-by: Parthiban Nallathambi <parthiban@linumiz.com>
---
 gcc/config.gcc                                |   1 +
 gcc/config/v850/constraints.md                |   5 +
 gcc/config/v850/fxu.md                        | 337 ++++++++++++++
 gcc/config/v850/v850.cc                       | 339 ++++++++++++++
 gcc/config/v850/v850_fxu.h                    |  64 +++
 gcc/doc/extend.texi                           | 262 +++++++++++
 gcc/doc/invoke.texi                           |   1 +
 .../gcc.target/v850/fxu-builtins-as.c         |   4 +
 gcc/testsuite/gcc.target/v850/fxu-builtins.c  | 434 ++++++++++++++++++
 gcc/testsuite/gcc.target/v850/fxu-compat.c    |  18 +
 .../gcc.target/v850/fxu-header-nofxu.c        |   5 +
 gcc/testsuite/gcc.target/v850/fxu-imm.c       |  17 +
 .../gcc.target/v850/fxu-lane-order-run.c      |  46 ++
 gcc/testsuite/gcc.target/v850/fxu-nofxu.c     |  12 +
 14 files changed, 1545 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 gcc/config/v850/v850_fxu.h
 create mode 100644 gcc/testsuite/gcc.target/v850/fxu-builtins-as.c
 create mode 100644 gcc/testsuite/gcc.target/v850/fxu-builtins.c
 create mode 100644 gcc/testsuite/gcc.target/v850/fxu-compat.c
 create mode 100644 gcc/testsuite/gcc.target/v850/fxu-header-nofxu.c
 create mode 100644 gcc/testsuite/gcc.target/v850/fxu-imm.c
 create mode 100644 gcc/testsuite/gcc.target/v850/fxu-lane-order-run.c
 create mode 100644 gcc/testsuite/gcc.target/v850/fxu-nofxu.c

